    "body": "BASE-FIRST repair for the physical Windows 10 blocker observed on owner PC: `podman machine init` reaches first VM creation but fails because `ssh-keygen` is missing from `%PATH%`.\n\nScope is host prerequisite only. No SHERIFF policy/schema/runtime changes.\n\nTDD: first commit is intentionally RED and requires OpenSSH Client repair before first Podman machine initialization. Official Windows mechanism is `OpenSSH.Client~~~~0.0.1.0` via `Add-WindowsCapability`.\n\nAfter GREEN: Windows PowerShell 5.1 validation + HQ + OSS + full runtime E2E, then independent review before merge.",
    "closed_at": null,
